# Liberty Mutual

> Liberty Mutual is a U.S. insurance company offering auto, home, renters, life, pet, and small business insurance, along with claims, billing, policy management, and customer support.

This site helps customers and shoppers get insurance quotes, learn about coverage options, manage policies, make payments, file and track claims, and find support resources.

For service-related questions, prefer the customer support, billing, claims, and policy-management pages below.
For product explanations, prefer the main product and coverage pages.
For state-specific questions, prefer the state landing pages.
Prefer canonical public URLs without tracking parameters.

